</head><body><div class="topbar"><div class="container"><span>Grid-to-Plug Solutions · Power Distribution · EV Charging Infrastructure</span><span>Email: xuke@link-jl.com · WhatsApp: +86 13201571341</span></div></div>
<header><div class="container nav"><a href="../" class="brand"><span class="mark">A</span><span>Apex Power Systems</span></a><div class="navlinks"><a href="../">Home</a><a href="../products/">Products</a><a href="../solutions/">Solutions</a><a href="../projects/">Projects</a><a href="../about/">About</a><a href="./">Quality</a><a href="../certificates/">Certificates</a><a href="../resources/">Resources</a><a href="../contact/">Contact</a></div><a class="btn btn-orange" href="../contact/">Request A Quote</a></div></header><main>
<section class="hero"><div class="container"><div><span class="kicker">Quality & Manufacturing</span><h1>Manufacturing Capability for Grid-to-Plug Equipment</h1><p>Production, assembly, testing, inspection, and export support for Apex power distribution and EV charging infrastructure products.</p><a class="btn btn-orange" href="../contact/">Request Factory Information</a></div><div class="hero-img"><img src="../assets/integrated/production-01.jpg" alt="Apex manufacturing"></div></div></section>
<section><div class="container"><span class="kicker">Capability</span><h2>Production & Inspection Process</h2><p class="lead">Apex supports project-based equipment supply through structured production coordination, assembly, inspection, testing, packing, and technical documentation.</p><div class="grid grid-4" style="margin-top:28px"><div class="card step"><b>1</b><h3>Material Preparation</h3><p>Core components, cabinet structures, electrical devices, terminals, and accessories are prepared according to order requirements.</p></div><div class="card step"><b>2</b><h3>Assembly</h3><p>Products are assembled according to electrical design, cabinet layout, wiring requirements, and project configuration.</p></div><div class="card step"><b>3</b><h3>Testing</h3><p>Routine tests and functional checks are performed according to product type and project needs.</p></div><div class="card step"><b>4</b><h3>Export Delivery</h3><p>Packing, documentation, and delivery communication support overseas project requirements.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="soft"><div class="container"><span class="kicker">Factory Gallery</span><h2>Production Photos</h2><p class="lead">Real production and workshop materials help strengthen buyer confidence and project evaluation.</p><div class="grid grid-4" style="margin-top:28px"><div class='card'><img src='../assets/integrated/production-01.jpg' alt='Apex production 1'><span class='tag'>Manufacturing</span><h3>Production Workshop</h3><p>Workshop and equipment scenes supporting electrical equipment manufacturing.</p></div><div class='card'><img src='../assets/integrated/production-02.jpg' alt='Apex production 2'><span class='tag'>Manufacturing</span><h3>Assembly Process</h3><p>Assembly process for power distribution or EV charging infrastructure equipment.</p></div><div class='card'><img src='../assets/integrated/production-03.jpg' alt='Apex production 3'><span class='tag'>Manufacturing</span><h3>Testing & Inspection</h3><p>Inspection and test processes supporting project delivery.</p></div><div class='card'><img src='../assets/integrated/production-04.jpg' alt='Apex production 4'><span class='tag'>Manufacturing</span><h3>Electrical Equipment Production</h3><p>Production capability for substations, cabinets, chargers, and control equipment.</p></div><div class='card'><img src='../assets/integrated/production-05.jpg' alt='Apex production 5'><span class='tag'>Manufacturing</span><h3>Component Processing</h3><p>Production process and component preparation for customized equipment.</p></div><div class='card'><img src='../assets/integrated/production-05.jpg' alt='Apex production 6'><span class='tag'>Manufacturing</span><h3>Final Assembly</h3><p>Final product assembly and inspection before packing.</p></div><div class='card'><img src='../assets/integrated/production-07.jpg' alt='Apex production 7'><span class='tag'>Manufacturing</span><h3>Workshop Management</h3><p>Manufacturing organization supporting international project supply.</p></div><div class='card'><img src='../assets/integrated/production-08.jpg' alt='Apex production 8'><span class='tag'>Manufacturing</span><h3>Packing & Delivery</h3><p>Export-oriented packing and shipment preparation.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section><div class="container"><span class="kicker">Quality Control</span><h2>Project-Based Quality Support</h2><div class="grid grid-3"><div class="card"><h3>Technical Review</h3><p>Review drawings, voltage, capacity, standard, charging power, and installation environment before production.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Process Inspection</h3><p>Follow assembly inspection, wiring check, structure inspection, and electrical test requirements.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Documentation</h3><p>Provide datasheets, certificates, photos, packing information, and export documents according to order needs.</p></div></div></div></section>
</main><footer><div class="container"><div class="footer-grid"><div><a href="../" class="brand" style="color:white;margin-bottom:12px"><span class="mark">A</span><span>Apex Power Systems</span></a><p>Grid-to-Plug power distribution and EV charging infrastructure solutions from transformer to intelligent charging controller.</p><p>Email: xuke@link-jl.com<br>WhatsApp: +86 13201571341</p></div><div><h4>Power Distribution</h4><ul><li>Power Transformers</li><li>Prefabricated Substations</li><li>KYN28-12 Switchgear</li><li>GCS / GGD / XL Cabinets</li></ul></div><div><h4>EV Charging</h4><ul><li>DC Fast Charging Piles</li><li>AC Charging Piles</li><li>480kW Group Charging</li><li>Heavy-Duty Truck Chargers</li></ul></div><div><h4>Controllers</h4><ul><li>JC-6513 Hub Controller</li><li>JC-6512 DC Controller</li><li>JC-6650 AC Controller</li><li>OCPP Protocol Board</li></ul></div><div><h4>Company</h4><ul><li>About Apex</li><li>Projects</li><li>Quality Control</li><li>Certificates</li><li>Contact / RFQ</li></ul></div></div><div class="footer-row"><span>© 2026 Apex Power Systems Co., Ltd.</span><span>Power Distribution · EV Charging · Grid-to-Plug Solutions</span></div></div></footer></body></html>